meta {
  name: Pages - Create - Lesson with video
  type: http
  seq: 118
}

post {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/spaces/<cuid of a course space>/pages
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "title": "Install Obsidian",
    "body": "Download Obsidian and open your first vault.",
    "video_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ"
  }
}

docs {
  A lesson of a course space (#1188, ADR 0029): a page with an optional video. video_url accepts YouTube (watch, youtu.be, shorts, embed) and Vimeo addresses only; the answer gives video.embed_url (youtube-nocookie.com, or Vimeo with dnt=1). 400 for another host, or for a video in a page space or on a section. Needs pages:write.
}
